The server was originally designed and implemented by Dongho Han (Seoul National University) as
server_distributed.py; it was packaged, hardened and extended by Jingyu Lee (Seoul National University).

This repository contains no model weights and no code from Meta's SAM 3 or SAM 3D Objects releases. At run time the
server loads, from locations the user installs them to:

  * SAM 3 (https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3) through Hugging Face Transformers, and
  * SAM 3D Objects (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam-3d-objects and
    https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam-3d-objects),

both "SAM Materials" under Meta's SAM License (Last Updated: November 19, 2025). Users obtain them directly from
Meta's gated repositories and are bound by that licence, including its acknowledgement requirement for publications
and its Trade Control restrictions. SAM 3D Objects in turn downloads MoGe (https://huggingface.co/Ruicheng/moge-vitl,
MIT).

Third-party Python packages used at run time are listed in THIRD_PARTY.md. None are vendored here.
